 "On the other machine (Linux, or macOS with Docker), run once in a terminal:": "在另一台机器上（Linux，或安装了 Docker 的 macOS），在终端中运行一次：",
 "The link is on a temporary address of its own (no domain needed); it closes once the machine is paired or the link expires.": "该链接位于独立的临时地址（无需域名）；机器配对完成或链接过期后，该地址即失效。",
 "Route": "连接方式",
 "Its own computer (a container of its own): open the PC tab.": "拥有独立电脑（独立容器）：请打开 PC 标签页。",
 "terminal": "终端",
 "Terminal: only for a computer that browses directly (its shell could read the proxy or VPN secret).": "终端：仅适用于直接联网的电脑（其 shell 可能读取代理或 VPN 密钥）。",
 "With the terminal app it browses directly: a shell in it could read a proxy or VPN secret.": "使用终端应用时将直接联网：其中的 shell 可能读取代理或 VPN 密钥。",
 "If it reaches none of them, the command stops before setting anything up and says what to do.": "若无法连接到任何地址，命令将在进行任何设置前停止，并提示处理方法。",
 "direct, encrypted end to end": "直连，端到端加密",
 "Still offline? That machine may not reach Agentown: put both on the same network, install Tailscale on both, or give Agentown an address it can reach (an open port, a domain or a tunnel).": "仍然离线？该机器可能无法连接 Agentown：请让两者处于同一网络、在两端都安装 Tailscale，或为 Agentown 提供其可访问的地址（开放端口、域名或隧道）。",
 "It connects directly, encrypted end to end, to the first of these it can reach: {list}.": "该机器将直接连接（端到端加密）到其可以访问的第一个地址：{list}。",
 "From another network, port {port} of this server must be open (its firewall or router).": "若从其他网络连接，本服务器的 {port} 端口必须开放（防火墙或路由器）。",
 "Only a machine on the same network (or on Tailscale with this one) can connect. For a machine elsewhere: install Tailscale on both, or give Agentown an address it can reach (an open port, a domain or a tunnel).": "只有同一网络中的机器（或与本机同在 Tailscale 中的机器）才能连接。对于其他位置的机器：请在两端安装 Tailscale，或为 Agentown 提供其可访问的地址（开放端口、域名或隧道）。",
 "Works once, until {time}. It installs Docker if missing, starts the computer there and remembers its key: no pairing again later.": "仅可使用一次，有效期至 {time}。若缺少 Docker 会自动安装，并在该机器上启动电脑且记住其密钥：之后无需再次配对。",
